Chapter: ChapterPaginationDuplicatePage

 Both pages call themselves page 1. The count is right and every page
 carries a marker, so the coarser checks pass -- but a chapter cannot
 have two first pages, and a repeated number means one of them was
 copied and never renumbered.

Section: First
  alpha : Integer
  alpha = 1

